WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Initializing a new architectural project
and setting up the workspace environment.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Importing hand-drawn pen sketches into
the digital modeling interface.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Calibrating the raster map scale to ensure
accurate real-world dimensional mapping.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Detecting structural walls automatically using
OpenCV-based computer vision algorithms.

5
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.000
Human-in-the-loop verification: reviewing,
editing, and saving detected wall geometries.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Segmenting rooms based on validated walls with
manual confirmation for spatial accuracy.

7
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Defining room usability; auto-generating cost
items and quantities based on functional type.

8
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Customizing and updating default unit costs
to align with current market pricing standards.

9
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Exporting the finalized model in Sweet Home 3D
format (.sh3d) for external compatibility.

10
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000


11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Generating native-language reports via Text-to-SQL;
converting natural queries into database insights.